"buildr/accordion-item - Accordion item (ui, v1)
One section of an accordion.
Props:
- summary (text) default "Question" [bindable, localizable]
- defaultOpen (boolean) default false [bindable]
Slots:
- default: buildr/container, buildr/grid, buildr/spacer, buildr/anchor, buildr/heading, buildr/text, buildr/rich-text, buildr/button, buildr/link, buildr/image, buildr/video, buildr/iframe, buildr/carousel, buildr/gallery, buildr/icon, buildr/list, buildr/divider, buildr/badge, buildr/card, buildr/accordion, buildr/loop, buildr/pagination, buildr/form, buildr/fieldset, buildr/input, buildr/textarea, buildr/select, buildr/checkbox
Note: It cannot be inserted on its own; include it as a child inside a tree of buildr/accordion, buildr/loop.
Note: It can only be placed directly inside buildr/accordion, buildr/loop.
Note: It needs an accessible name (text, label or aria-label).
Style groups: spacing, background, border, typography, effects, motion, visibility
Renders: details
Insert into: buildr/page[default]
Example: {"type":"buildr/accordion","slots":{"default":[{"type":"buildr/accordion-item","props":{"summary":"Question"}}]}}"
`;

