"buildr/button - Button (content, v1)
A button, or a link that looks like one.
Props:
- label (text) default "Button" [bindable, localizable]
- href (link) default "" [bindable, localizable]
- type (select) default "button" one of "button" | "submit"
- variant (select) default "primary" one of "primary" | "secondary" | "outline" | "ghost"
- size (select) default "md" one of "sm" | "md" | "lg"
- icon (icon) default ""
- iconPosition (select) default "start" one of "start" | "end"
- ariaLabel (text) default "" [bindable, localizable]
- newTab (boolean) default false [bindable]
Slots: none (a leaf component, it takes no children)
Note: It needs an accessible name (text, label or aria-label).
Style groups: typography, spacing, background, border, size, effects, motion, visibility
Renders: button
Insert into: buildr/page[default]
Example: {"type":"buildr/button","props":{"label":"Button"}}"
`;

